cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use thermal-rc-toolbox in your research, please cite this software (see below)."
title: thermal-rc-toolbox
abstract: >
  A Python toolbox for calibration and simulation of RC thermal models for
  building indoor dynamics and heat pump demand, with an actuator-aware 5R1C
  model (EN ISO 13790:2008), a genetic-algorithm identification pipeline,
  and HDBSCAN clustering of the final candidate pool.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
# TODO: replace with the Zenodo DOI minted for the cited release once published.
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX
repository-code: "https://github.com/davudtopalovic/thermal-rc-toolbox"
url: "https://github.com/davudtopalovic/thermal-rc-toolbox"
authors:
  - family-names: Topalovic
    given-names: Davud
    # TODO: add ORCID id when available
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
keywords:
  - thermal modeling
  - RC model
  - 5R1C
  - building energy
  - heat pump
  - system identification
  - genetic algorithm
  - EN ISO 13790

